<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>데이터 소스와 API on JsonXcel Learn</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m03-datasource-api/</link><description>Recent content in 데이터 소스와 API on JsonXcel Learn</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><atom:link href="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m03-datasource-api/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>단일 데이터 소스 ds</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m03-datasource-api/m03-l01-single-ds/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m03-datasource-api/m03-l01-single-ds/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send exactly one business payload via the &lt;code&gt;ds&lt;/code&gt; field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep &lt;code&gt;ds&lt;/code&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;JSON string&lt;/strong&gt; inside the HTTP JSON body&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map workbook markers to that single object (or array root, when the template expects it)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
