&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Switch &lt;code&gt;output_format&lt;/code&gt; between &lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;excel&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;pdf&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; without changing JSON shape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design templates with print layout in mind when PDF is a first-class deliverable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know that PDF is a snapshot while Excel keeps editable formulas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
